; PsiLinux-Doom 0.25 (test): Doom on the Psion's own screen, for PsiLinux 0.25
; and later: doomgeneric built for the 5mx (ports/build-doom.sh) and id
; Software's shareware episode (doom1.wad, unmodified). In PsiLinux:
; sh /d/Linux/Doom/doom (or /c/... if installed on C:).
&EN
#{"PsiLinux Doom"},(0x01000A93),0,25,0
"doom"-"!:\Linux\Doom\doom"
"doomgeneric"-"!:\Linux\Doom\doomgeneric"
"doom1.wad"-"!:\Linux\Doom\doom1.wad"
"licences.txt"-"!:\Linux\Doom\Licences.txt"
